  "subtitles": [
    {
      "startSeconds": 0.0,
      "endSeconds": 1.851,
      "text": "豆包想给你点外卖"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 1.851,
      "endSeconds": 3.69,
      "text": "但是美团说不行"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 3.69,
      "endSeconds": 6.41,
      "text": "而且不光是美团说不行"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 6.41,
      "endSeconds": 8.8688,
      "text": "总共有155个App"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 8.8688,
      "endSeconds": 10.59,
      "text": "都对豆包说No"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 10.85,
      "endSeconds": 13.45,
      "text": "上个月14号豆包发了一个"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 13.45,
      "endSeconds": 16.35,
      "text": "屏幕自动化操作声明"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 16.35,
      "endSeconds": 17.95,
      "text": "说白了就是"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 17.95,
      "endSeconds": 20.25,
      "text": "AI要替你点手机"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 20.25,
      "endSeconds": 22.65,
      "text": "但是App可以提前说"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 22.65,
      "endSeconds": 23.95,
      "text": "我不同意"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 23.95,
      "endSeconds": 26.45,
      "text": "公示整个有30天"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 26.45,
      "endSeconds": 29.45,
      "text": "10月14号名单才刚出来"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 29.55,
      "endSeconds": 30.915,
      "text": "这些App里面"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 30.915,
      "endSeconds": 33.08,
      "text": "腾讯总共是占了66款"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 33.08,
      "endSeconds": 34.49,
      "text": "包括微信"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 34.49,
      "endSeconds": 35.195,
      "text": "QQ"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 35.195,
      "endSeconds": 35.9,
      "text": "元宝"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 35.9,
      "endSeconds": 38.72,
      "text": "包括这些都在里面"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 38.72,
      "endSeconds": 40.618,
      "text": "然后阿里的话"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 40.618,
      "endSeconds": 42.833,
      "text": "总共占了23款"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 42.833,
      "endSeconds": 43.465,
      "text": "淘宝"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 43.465,
      "endSeconds": 44.415,
      "text": "支付宝"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 44.415,
      "endSeconds": 45.68,
      "text": "高德地图"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 45.68,
      "endSeconds": 48.46,
      "text": "快手总共是占了14款"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 48.46,
      "endSeconds": 51.24,
      "text": "美团总共是占了11款"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 51.24,
      "endSeconds": 53.221,
      "text": "就连DeepSeek"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 53.221,
      "endSeconds": 55.4,
      "text": "也拒绝了豆包的这个使用"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 55.6,
      "endSeconds": 56.8065,
      "text": "其实去年12月"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 56.8065,
      "endSeconds": 58.53,
      "text": "就已经闹过这么一次了"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 58.53,
      "endSeconds": 61.13,
      "text": "有人用豆包去操作微信"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 61.13,
      "endSeconds": 63.29,
      "text": "账号直接被踢下线了"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 63.55,
      "endSeconds": 65.081,
      "text": "大家有没有想过"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 65.081,
      "endSeconds": 67.412,
      "text": "为什么这些头部的大厂"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 67.412,
      "endSeconds": 68.81,
      "text": "都拒绝了豆包"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 68.81,
      "endSeconds": 72.17,
      "text": "其实我看就很简单的三个因素"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 72.17,
      "endSeconds": 73.53,
      "text": "一个是入口"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 73.53,
      "endSeconds": 74.89,
      "text": "一个是数据"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 74.89,
      "endSeconds": 76.25,
      "text": "一个是安全"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 76.25,
      "endSeconds": 78.61,
      "text": "你本来要打开的是淘宝"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 78.61,
      "endSeconds": 81.57,
      "text": "如果说现在只需要对豆包说一句"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 82.57,
      "endSeconds": 84.203,
      "text": "那么淘宝的首页"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 84.203,
      "endSeconds": 85.137,
      "text": "它的推荐"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 85.137,
      "endSeconds": 86.07,
      "text": "它的广告"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 86.07,
      "endSeconds": 86.77,
      "text": "谁来看"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 86.77,
      "endSeconds": 89.77,
      "text": "AI在App里点来点去"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 89.77,
      "endSeconds": 91.299,
      "text": "你所看到的东西"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 91.299,
      "endSeconds": 92.61,
      "text": "它都过了一遍"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 92.6167,
      "endSeconds": 94.6847,
      "text": "然后付钱聊天"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 94.6847,
      "endSeconds": 95.7187,
      "text": "出了事"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 95.7187,
      "endSeconds": 97.0967,
      "text": "该算谁的"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 97.2,
      "endSeconds": 98.7,
      "text": "对于我们普通人来说"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 98.7,
      "endSeconds": 101.46,
      "text": "AI替你点外卖打车"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 101.46,
      "endSeconds": 102.74,
      "text": "听着很方便"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 102.74,
      "endSeconds": 104.54,
      "text": "但是现在的这扇门"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 104.54,
      "endSeconds": 107.14,
      "text": "得这些大公司点头才行"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 107.14,
      "endSeconds": 108.42,
      "text": "所以接下来的问题"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 108.42,
      "endSeconds": 110.42,
      "text": "并不是AI到底行不行"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 110.42,
      "endSeconds": 112.66,
      "text": "而是平台让不让"
    }
  ],
